e opposite he was  extremely impressed with yami's magic  and he wanted to learn more about it  after meeting and befriending julius  yami was brought into the magic knights  he met knocked and morgan and he met  many other mages who would end up  becoming powerful magic knight captains  so yami eventually did make friends in  the clover kingdom despite being a  foreigner with a strange magic that said  this chapter is definitely placing a  strong emphasis on the nature of yami's  magic the chapter really wants us to  keep dark magic in mind and how this  magic has shaped yami's life since his  youth we also learned that morgen was  especially influential on yami's early  life morgan told yami that the nature of  his magic doesn't matter magic is only  as good or evil as the one who wields it  and since yami is a good person there is  nothing sinister about his dark magic  his dark magic will be used for good  back then yami didn't show much interest  in the magic knights and he certainly  didn't show any interest in becoming a  magic knight captain but after the  tragic death of morgen something in yami  changed he decided that he needed to  form his own magic knights brigade and  since all the respectable people already  had magic knight captains who would be  interested in them yami decided to make  a squad for the misfits of society those  who had bad luck in life those who lost  their way those were outcasts and made  mistakes in the past yami decided to get  as strong as possible so that he would  be worthy of becoming a magic knight  captain and once he did that he set  about recruiting all of the black bulls  that we know and loved today yami wanted  to give these misfits and outcasts a  place to belong a place where they could  use their magic freely and be themselves  but in truth by forming the black bulls  the one who was really given a place to  belong was yami himself the black bulls  became yami's family and he no longer  felt like a lonely ostracized outcast  because all the black bulls could now be  outcasts together this was honestly so  heartwarming for all of his quirks and  aggressive personality traits yami truly  loves his squad and they mean everything  to him yami is like my favorite  character in the whole story alongside  asta and his defining feature has always  been his incredible strength and general  badassery but there was always something  more to yami a deeply kind and caring  inner core we've always known about it  but now the story is actually focusing  on that aspect of yami and i absolutely  love it i've always wanted to learn more  about yami and about the mysterious land  that he came from so i do hope that  we're going to continue to learn about  him in the coming chapters we then jump  to a flashback of morris talking about  yami's magic after he had already been  captured by zena according to morris  dark magic is imbued with the magical  power of the underworld so apparently  dark magic is a magic that is somehow  directly connected to the devils and the  underworld that explains why dark magic  was actually effective against zagred as  a creature of the underworld zagred was  not resistant to dark magic because dark  magic is connected to the underworld  itself anyway morris says that he needs  dark magic to die william's world tree  magic black and this is what will allow  the underworld to connect directly to  the human world through the cliff off  morris sees yami as the chosen one as  someone destined to bring death despair  and darkness into this world his dark  magic is the key to the cliff  and it is because of his magic that the  cliffhoth will be opened and the human  world will be destroyed in this sense  morris is essentially implying that all  of the fears that the clover kingdom  citizens had about yami were actually  true he really was destined to bring  misfortune to everyone but morris can  say what he wants we know that our boy  yami would never accept such a fate and  he will fight against destiny itself if  he has to with his black bulls by his  side then back in the present we see the  black bulls rushing towards yami and  calling out his name with morris still  incapacitated yami is able to open his  eyes and then he begins to laugh he asks  the black bulls whether they really like  him that much and as they respond yeah  we do all at the same time yami says so  do i you idiots yes after over 50  chapters and over a year in real world  time yami is finally reunited with the  black bulls i loved this moment and  honestly i've been waiting for it for a  long time as i said earlier yami is one  of my favorite characters and i  absolutely love the black bulls they are  easily one of the best squads in anime  so seeing them all together again is  freaking beautiful even knocked is there  to witness all of this although he seems  to be keeping his distance and it looks  like he's like sitting up on the roof  referring to the black bulls he says  you're all a bunch of lunatics i'll give  you that and yeah that makes sense we  know that knocked is super anti-social  but i get the feeling that even he has a  soft spot in his heart for the black  bulls everything seems to be great at  this point the long-awaited reunion is  finally here but then the second gate is  already opening the black bulls have  just reunited with yami after all this  time and they assembled in the same  place for the first time in a very long  time but as i predicted in my previous  black clover videos the black bulls will  not have any time to celebrate yes they  finally reached yami and they might even  successfully rescue him but then they're  going to have to turn right around and  fight all the devils that are about to  come into the human world from the  second gate of the underworld and this  will apparently include lucifer in his  true body and while yeah it kind of  sucks that the black bulls can't  celebrate their achievement this is also  going to be absolutely hype and if  mimosa could show up and heal yami right  about now then we might get to see all  the black bulls fighting it out against  lucifer and the other devils and that  would be amazing after all that emphasis  on yami's dark magic i can't wait to see  him in action again and i can't wait to  see what dark magic is truly capable of  in terms of fighting the devils let me  know what you guys think are you hyped  for this epic reunion and are you  excited for the battle against lucifer  also why do you think that yami received  a clover grimoire even though he is a  foreigner and why exactly do you think  that his magic is connected to the  underworld is it all just a coincidence  the luck of the draw  or is there something more that we're  going to learn later finally is morris  really ko'd already or is he actually  going to recover and do something  definitely share your thoughts down in  the comments below if you enjoyed this  black clover video and you want us to  keep it coming just leave a quick like  it only takes a second but it helps a  lot and if you're new to anime pro or  maybe you watch our videos but you just  haven't taken the time to subscribe yet  do me a quick favor and make this the  video that you subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications you really have to go  through the trouble of subscribing  hitting that bell and then selecting the  option that says all if you don't do  that you're still going to miss a ton of  our videos even if you are subscribed  it's just how youtube works you can also  hit me up on twitter and instagram at  animeopror a big thank you to all of our  anime uproar patrons who make videos  like this one possible special thank you  to alpha sigma this man is an absolute  mad lad and a disciple of lord twego  himself i also can't forget all of our  the one tier patrons the ones who rise  above all other clans including ingrata  algital  hinokami in water the toasted cheek  cor